## Sessions

### Triggers
- **`start`** → read CLAUDE.md (this file) + SESSION.md + brief status format
- **`accio!`** → save+commit ritual: update SESSION.md, update RUBY_BRIEF.md, version bump, single commit
- **`monyet!`** → mid-session save signal for strategic decisions
- **`sync!`** → cross-repo state pull (consumer-side, see ~/Documents/ruby-assistant/CLAUDE.md sync! protocol)

### Session start checklist
