## How to use this template

1. Fork this file into the root of your repo as `CLAUDE.md`.
2. Replace every `[PLACEHOLDER]` with project-specific content.
3. Delete sections you don't need (most projects don't need all sections).
4. Add sections specific to your domain (e.g. for a content site, add "Editorial voice rules").
5. Keep updating it. Stale CLAUDE.md = production incidents (see `examples/article-5-db-orphan.md` for a real case).

This template extracted from running 8+ active ventures. See parent `claude-code-kit` repo for context.
